"end": 7356,
"text": "Our top-scoring Best Buy VPN\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L256",
"start": 7356,
"end": 7560,
"text": "Proton VPN is a service that will do all it can to protect your privacy. All of its applications are open source and audited by third parties, and it has a robust privacy policy. Spoiler, it’s very good.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L257",
"start": 7560,
"end": 7704,
"text": "@ProtonVPN (new window) is ads free, strict no-logs policy and completely Open Source VPN. I'm highly recommending for an extremely secure VPN.\n"
},
