{
"id": "S1L288",
"start": 9351,
"end": 9484,
"text": "Yes. Proton VPN offers a Free plan with no data limits, no artificial speed limits, and no compromises on your privacy and security.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L289",
"start": 9484,
"end": 9783,
"text": "We’re able to offer Proton VPN Free thanks to the support of the Proton community. If you’d like to help us fight for online privacy and digital freedom around the world, please consider getting a paid plan with faster speeds, access to servers in over 140 countries, and all our advanced features.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L290",
"start": 9783,
"end": 9815,
"text": "What payment methods can I use?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L291",
"start": 9815,
"end": 9828,
"text": "View details\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L292",
"start": 9828,
"end": 10013,
"text": "You can pay using Visa, Mastercard, American Express, PayPal, or Proton credits. Once you’ve created an account, you can purchase Proton credits using cash, bank transfers, or Bitcoin.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L293",
"start": 10013,
"end": 10070,
"text": "Can I cancel my subscription if Proton VPN isn't for me?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L294",
"start": 10070,
"end": 10083,
"text": "View details\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L295",
"start": 10083,
"end": 10323,
"text": "Yes. You may cancel your subscription at any time. We provide a money-back guarantee for all subscriptions if requested within the first 30 days. To see our full refund policy, please read our Terms and Conditions of Service (new window) .\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L296",
"start": 10323,
"end": 10370,
"text": "Can I switch to a new plan whenever I want to?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L297",
"start": 10370,
"end": 10383,
"text": "View details\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L298",
"start": 10383,
"end": 10686,
"text": "Yes. You can switch to a new plan any time you like. Whether you're changing your plan duration (for example, from a Proton VPN Plus 1-month to a 1-year subscription) or upgrading to a different plan (for example, from Proton VPN Plus to Proton Unlimited), we'll apply prorated credit toward your plan.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L299",
"start": 10686,
"end": 10931,
"text": "If you downgrade from Proton Unlimited to Proton VPN Plus (or any other Proton plan), your account will need to match what’s included in the new plan. This may mean deactivating some email addresses and calendars or reducing your storage usage.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L300",
"start": 10931,
"end": 10959,
"text": "Do you offer any discounts?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L301",
