},
{
"id": "S1L302",
"start": 10972,
"end": 11245,
"text": "Yes. You can get up to a 65% discount on the monthly price if you get the Proton VPN Plus 2-year deal, a 55% discount on the monthly price if you get the Proton VPN Plus 1-year plan, or up to a 38% discount on the monthly price if you get the Proton Unlimited 2-year plan.\n"
},
